# Build output. `bin\refl2952.exe` is reproducible from `refl2952.cpp` by
# running `build-refl2952.cmd`, and a committed binary would be both large and
# unverifiable -- .obj and .exe also embed absolute paths, which cannot be
# redacted. `run-refl2952.cmd` rebuilds it on demand, so a fresh clone needs no
# extra step.
bin/
bin-build.log
# Containers emitted by measure.py for the RDAT half of the release matrix.
# Re-created by `python measure.py --history`.
out/
